  "body": "## Goal\nReplace the blanket \"no editing while active negotiations exist\" rule with field-aware edit restrictions.\n\nThe bot must still be STOPPED before any edit is saved, so Playwright never reads a configuration while it is being changed.\n\n## Editable while NEGOTIATING / ACTION_REQUIRED listings exist\n- bot display name\n- minimum listing price\n- maximum listing price\n- daily negotiation budget\n- global automatic negotiation cap (`maxAutomaticOffer`)\n\nThe global cap may be lowered, but never below the highest price already sent in any active negotiation.\n\n## Locked while active negotiations exist\n- Vinted e-mail\n- Vinted password\n- marketplace\n- category\n- brand\n- target mode\n- model / search query\n- adaptive-pricing mode toggle\n- negotiation-step count/order\n- step offer prices\n- accepted-counteroffer thresholds\n- step messages\n\nThese fields define account identity, listing target, or the meaning of `currentStep`; changing them mid-conversation could make an existing negotiation inconsistent.\n\n## Backend\n- add `/api/bots/{botId}/edit-capabilities`\n- return `hasActiveNegotiations` and `minimumNegotiationCap`\n- validate only critical-field changes when active negotiations exist\n- allow safe operational fields without replacing negotiation-step entities\n- requeue `SKIPPED_OUTSIDE_PRICE_RANGE` when the price range changes\n- continue requeueing `SKIPPED_OFFER_TOO_LOW` when pricing behavior materially changes\n\n## Frontend\n- Edit Bot page enters a limited-edit mode when active negotiations exist\n- critical controls are individually disabled instead of disabling the whole form\n- global cap remains editable and shows the minimum allowed value based on already-sent active offers\n- explanatory messages show exactly why each locked section is locked\n\n## Tests\nAdded backend unit coverage for:\n- safe operational edits with an active negotiation\n- rejecting a cap below an already-sent offer\n- rejecting target/model changes\n- rejecting negotiation-step changes\n- rejecting Vinted account changes\n- edit-capability calculation across NEGOTIATING and ACTION_REQUIRED listings\n- preserving full structural editing when there are no active negotiations",
